WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.001
This is everything you need

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.793
to know about The Witcher,

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:04.337
Season One, in just 60 seconds.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.256
We find Geralt in Blaviken.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:09.300
He meets a lady called Renfri
and a mage called Stregobor.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.012
They have a disagreement,
ultimately he ends up

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.054
killing Renfri.

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:14.055
Yennefer inadvertently

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.557
discovers she can use magic.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:16.808
Ascends to become a mage.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.351
Transforms her body to
become more beautiful,

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.228
but sacrifices her uterus in the process.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:22.397
He ends up, unfortunately,
getting mixed up

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.774
with a cursed knight who
looks like a hedgehog

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.860
and picking up a Child Surprise.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.028
Ciri is the Princess of

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.529
Cintra, a powerful kingdom,

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.156
which gets invaded by Nilfgaard.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.949
They accidentally release a Djinn.

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:35.535
Jaskier gets a nasty throat...thing.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.371
He's healed by a crazy, sexy witch.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.373
Yennefer tries to become
the vessel for the Djinn

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.666
to cure her infertility.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:43.376
But Geralt saves her with
a wish that will come back

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.294
to bite them both.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.004
Ciri steals a
horse, kills some robbers

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.047
with her magical scream.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:47.964
They go on a dragon hunt.

00:00:47.964 --> 00:00:49.215
He helps save the Golden Dragon.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.092
Golden Dragon then
tells a secret about him

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:53.053
and Yennefer gets very upset and leaves.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.763
Jaskier gets blamed by Geralt

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.264
for all his misfortune and abandoned.

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:57.557
Yennefer joins mages

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.725
in the Battle of Sodden Hill.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.102
Ciri dreams of Geralt looking
for someone called Yennefer,

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:02.270
wakes up, runs into the woods.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.855
As he's walking through the woods,

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.441
he finds his Child Surprise, Cirilla.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:07.776
The wait is over,

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:10.695
The Witcher, Season Two,
is now streaming on Netflix.

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:21.498
Did I win?

